    "detailed_description": "Under the full moon's light of Halloween, a skeleton decides to grab fate by the bones and become nobility - the hard way. After all, if you collect every single crown in the crypt, you ARE the Skeleton King!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLose yourself in this relaxing, realistic runner while realizing it's really about a restless reliquary that's actually rather scary, due to the animated skeletons of course. To be honest it's not a bad excuse for a Halloween game that's eerily realistic looking.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour character moves faster as the games goes on, can slowly regenerate &quot;health&quot;, and dies when you run out.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nObstacles remove a single hit point, while enemy skeletons cost you 5. Enemy Mummies will deal 10 damage, and Werewolves deal 50, so watch out!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUse Left and Right keys (or A and D) to move left and right.",
    "about_the_game": "Under the full moon's light of Halloween, a skeleton decides to grab fate by the bones and become nobility - the hard way. After all, if you collect every single crown in the crypt, you ARE the Skeleton King!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLose yourself in this relaxing, realistic runner while realizing it's really about a restless reliquary that's actually rather scary, due to the animated skeletons of course. To be honest it's not a bad excuse for a Halloween game that's eerily realistic looking.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour character moves faster as the games goes on, can slowly regenerate &quot;health&quot;, and dies when you run out.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nObstacles remove a single hit point, while enemy skeletons cost you 5. Enemy Mummies will deal 10 damage, and Werewolves deal 50, so watch out!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUse Left and Right keys (or A and D) to move left and right.",
    "short_description": "Lose yourself in this relaxing, realistic runner while realizing it's really about a restless reliquary that's actually rather scary, due to the animated skeletons. It's an atmospheric, spooky, casual game that's perfect for Halloween fun!",
